1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,967
Run your ATEM from mobile.

2
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:08,733
This is CastPad: a remote control app for Blackmagic ATEM.

3
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:12,900
It talks to your switcher directly: no cloud, no account.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,950
Choose your next shot in Preview.

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,500
Tap CUT, and it's on air.

6
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,067
Or fade it in with AUTO.

7
00:00:22,067 --> 00:00:24,450
And the layout is yours to build.

8
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:29,517
Try it in your browser, at castpad.app/demo.
